  "body": "Positioned in one of Milford’s most sought-after pockets, this beautifully renovated home offers an easy-care lifestyle in an unbeatable location. Just 230 metres from Milford Shopping Centre and a short stroll to the golden sands of Milford Beach, you’ll have shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday essentials right on your doorstep. The property is also zoned for Westlake Boys and Girls’ High Schools, Takapuna Grammar School and Milford School.\r\n\r\nFully renovated and beautifully presented, the home features double glazing and contemporary finishes, creating a fresh, modern feel throughout. The ground floor offers a stylish kitchen and open-plan dining and living area, flowing seamlessly outdoors to a generous north-facing garden and courtyard. Private, sunny and easy to maintain, this inviting outdoor space is perfect for entertaining, relaxing and enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite. Both the master and another bedroom enjoy direct access to a balcony, providing an additional sunny outdoor retreat. A separate laundry, single garage and additional off-street parking add everyday convenience. A shared walkway also provides a handy shortcut through to Cecil Road and onwards to Milford Beach.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re downsizing, a young family looking for a low-maintenance home in a prime location, investing or starting a new chapter with your family, this is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy the very best of Milford living.",
